  "title": "Cookie Dough for Ice Cream (Eggless)",
  "description": "A wonderful addition to any ice cream. Turn any vanilla ice cream into cookie dough. Much better than the store-bought cookie dough ice cream. NOTE: This does not include the ice cream recipe--just the dough.",
